    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Fit scale-normalized logarithmic spiral parameters to complete tusk centerlines of living elephants, American mastodons and mammoths, and extrapolate shorter curves with uncertainty. Shared parameters support size-only difference; significant taxon-specific curvature or torsion refutes it.";
