    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/assessmentType> "dataset-resolvability/0.2.0";
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/evidenceAgainst> "Many fossil tusks are incomplete or deformed.", "Sex, age and species produce substantial within-group variation.";
